    <p class="kicker">API reference</p>
    <h1 class="h-display">FirmLedger <em style="font-style:normal;color:var(--accent2)">API v1</em></h1>
    <p class="lede">REST access to FirmLedger — a <b>key-authenticated</b>, <b>production-ready</b> developer API to browse the public ledger and manage the records you own. Predictable, versioned JSON contract; honest rate limits; stable response shapes; included with <b>FirmLedger Pro</b>.</p>
    <p class="muted" style="max-width:720px;margin-top:6px"><span class="pill pill-approved">Production ready</span> · <code>v1</code> is the stable contract — response shapes and field names are guaranteed not to break. Breaking changes ship as <code>/api/v2</code>. Every endpoint, including <code>/health</code>, requires an API key.</p>
    <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:8px">
      <% if (user) { %><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/dashboard/api">Open your API console</a><% } else { %><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/pricing">Get Pro &amp; an API key</a><% } %>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="<%= user ? '/dashboard/api/playground' : '/login?next=/dashboard/api/playground' %>">Open the playground</a>
      <a class="btn btn-accent" href="/pricing">See pricing</a>
    </div>
